[COMMAND]:      git.dir
[PACKAGE]:      GIT
[USE]:          dock -git dir

[OUT]:          Returns the Bitbucket Git address of the current directory stored in the .env file.
                Return error if the current directory does not have an .env file.

[ACTIONS]:      N/A*

[NOTES]:        * For more information consult the script:

                /mnt/Dock/Scripts/git.sh
